,{"text":"수히물의","x":1083,"y":393,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"월주로와","x":1239,"y":393,"width":143,"height":39},{"text":"활주로","x":1397,"y":393,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"시회에서","x":1520,"y":392,"width":139,"height":40},{"text":"전송이","x":1681,"y":392,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"이루어","x":1801,"y":392,"width":93,"height":49}]},{"text":"진다. 각 계층은 (1) 그 계층에서 어떤 동작을 취하고(예: 답승구 계층에서 비행기에 사","words":[{"text":"진다.","x":549,"y":456,"width":74,"height":38},{"text":"각","x":640,"y":457,"width":34,"height":38},{"text":"계층은","x":687,"y":457,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"(1)","x":802,"y":461,"width":44,"height":35},{"text":"그","x":861,"y":461,"width":34,"height":26},{"text":"계층에서","x":910,"y":455,"width":133,"height":39},{"text":"어떤","x":1062,"y":453,"width":66,"height":40},{"text":"동작을","x":1143,"y":455,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"취하고(예:","x":1263,"y":455,"width":161,"height":40},{"text":"답승구","x":1441,"y":455,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"계층에서","x":1562,"y":454,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"비행기에","x":1720,"y":454,"width":131,"height":40},{"text":"사","x":1867,"y":464,"width":31,"height":38}]},{"text":"람을 오르내리게 하는 것), (2) 그 계층 바로 아래 계층 서비스를 이용함으로써(예: 답","words":[{"text":"람을","x":547,"y":517,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"오르내리게","x":629,"y":517,"width":171,"height":39},{"text":"하는","x":818,"y":517,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"것),","x":903,"y":517,"width":53,"height":38},{"text":"(2)","x":973,"y":520,"width":45,"height":35},{"text":"그","x":1034,"y":521,"width":35,"height":26},{"text":"계층","x":1086,"y":515,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"바로","x":1169,"y":515,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"아래","x":1254,"y":516,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"계층","x":1340,"y":516,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"서비스를","x":1426,"y":516,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"이용함으로써(예:","x":1583,"y":515,"width":266,"height":39},{"text":"답","x":1866,"y":525,"width":31,"height":37}]},{"text":"승구 계층에서 이착륙 계층의 활주로와 활주로 간의 승객 이동을 이용하는 것) 서비스","words":[{"text":"승구","x":545,"y